 "text": "Hey, good to have you. How are you? Set them on cold plate, or in cool box of ice cubes. Fill them from the bag instead of pouring out and refilling. Keep it in a thin blankie in pocket for a while, then on cold plate. Pop the bag open just enough so it doesn't burst in the cold box. It does, modestly. A cold bag inside a cool box helps a lot. Keep them in the shade and wrap them in cold towels. Fill them just before they go on, not more than an hour before.",
